              "title": "DESCRIPTION",
              "content": "<p><strong>2022-23 Golf Editors Choice </strong></p><p>The Series 3 Max rangefinder offers our most advanced software, next-generation design, ultra-premium materials, and a weather-proof case, all for a fraction of the cost compared to the competition.</p>",
