              "content": "<ul>\n<li>S3 Max Rangefinder</li>\n<li>Weather-Proof Carrying Case</li>\n<li>Mountaineer Buckle</li>\n<li>Lanyard</li>\n<li>Microfiber Cleaning Cloth</li>\n<li>(3) CR2-3V Batteries</li>\n<li>Blue Tees Sticker</li>\n<li>Manual &amp; Insert</li>\n</ul>",
