      "rich-text": {
        "type": "rich-text",
        "blocks": {
          "019e6153-1d5e-4a85-bc13-1e2a34598b2a": {
            "type": "heading",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "title": "WARRANTY"
            }
          },
          "ec7b3546-9e3a-42e9-b100-34a4f81ffb48": {
            "type": "text",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "enlarge_text": true,
              "text": "<p>Your Blue Tees Golf® laser rangefinder is warranted to function properly and to be free of defects in materials and workmanship for two years after the purchase date. Should there be a defect during the warranty period, we will replace the product, at our discretion, provided you pay for return shipping.</p><p>Defects and damages not covered by this warranty include those caused by improper handling, misuse, installation, or maintenance conducted by any one other than a Blue Tees Golf® Authorized Service Department.</p>"
            }
          }
        },
