              "text": "<p>Your Blue Tees Golf® laser rangefinder is warranted to function properly and to be free of defects in materials and workmanship for two years after the purchase date. Should there be a defect during the warranty period, we will replace the product, at our discretion, provided you pay for return shipping.<br/><br/>Defects and damages not covered by this warranty include those caused by improper handling, misuse, installation, or maintenance conducted by any one other than a Blue Tees Golf® Authorized Service Department.</p>"
