      "next-level-feature": {
        "type": "next-level-feature",
        "blocks": {
          "0ea367a4-374a-43c7-a82d-8b2a055fd87c": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24490.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Active slope switch tech enables the golfer to toggle on & off the slope feature to comply with USGA regulation.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/product_4cac3b05-1db5-4f88-b23c-07e4f0a0bf60_png.png"
            }
          },
          "8430b3b8-ef4a-4ac5-9011-1227c628db9d": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24504.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Next generation Flag-Lock & Pulse Vibration triggers short vibrating bursts to confirm a lock on any target - avoiding error and providing pin point accuracy.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/Carousel-FlagLock-Rendering-Mobile_3x_19c8b3a8-4b18-42f6-b5e1-ab7a05224b01_png.png"
            }
          },
          "e277114c-26af-4b6a-968e-e1765ecfe98a": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24487.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>A built-in magnet with two powerful magnetic plates enables an effortless and worry-free hold to yourgolf cart or accessory.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/BTG_S3-MAX_NAVY_3D-MODEL_2-view-6---pole_1.png"
            }
          },
          "8558b970-4850-4651-bcc4-c8d3b2617e10": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24483.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Relentless in any condition. Its rubberized plastic body and sealed seams leads to superior water resistance for those rainy days on the course.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/BTG_S3-MAX_NAVY_WATER-DROPLETS_3D-view-1_1_e10b6e51-72c7-4b92-a4fd-a7d1328c1b95.png"
            }
          },
          "4e9e7cc5-5fc9-4ea6-b4ed-2d043b09311a": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24486.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Whether it’s a lay-up, or from the black tee box on a par 5, its 900 yard range is sure to capture the exact distance to assist in choosing the right club.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24507.png"
            }
          },
          "10783578-0dba-4229-9c4a-0f2d59db3ca7": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24786.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Know your distances at all times. With Active Tracking, you will always know your exact distances while moving and looking through the lens.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/Carousel-Card-AutoAmbient-Rendering-Mobile_2x_d8e26f43-95b1-480b-bdde-4717c4ca1b67_png.png"
            }
          }
        },
