      "next-level-feature-series-3max-plus": {
        "type": "next-level-feature-series-3max-plus",
        "blocks": {
          "slide_EtcdTB": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24786.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Know your distances at all times. With Active Tracking, you will always know your exact distances while moving and looking through the lens.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/active-tracking-img.png"
            }
          },
          "slide_wYjkeK": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24504.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Advanced Flag Lock & Pulse Vibration triggers short vibrating bursts to confirm a lock on any target - avoiding error and providing pin point accuracy.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/advance-pluse-img.png"
            }
          },
          "slide_Jqrbnp": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/3max-plus-waterproof.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Throw out the batteries. The S3 Max+ comes equipped with a built-in rechargeable battery, powered by a waterproofUSB-C port (cable provided).</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/water-proof-usb-c-img.png"
            }
          },
          "slide_eRBRfE": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/3max-plus-magnatic-strip-icon.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>A built-in magnet with two powerful magnetic plates enables an effortless and worry-free, ultra-strong hold to yourgolf cart or accessory.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/magnatic-strip-img.png"
            }
          },
          "slide_BBYpwy": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24704.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>The Crystal Clear Display blows the competition out of the water. The clarity and visibility of the lens makes those far shots a breeze to see.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/crystal-clear-disp-img.png"
            }
          },
          "slide_eFwHbP": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_24483.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Relentless in any condition. Its rubberized plastic body and sealed seams leads to superior water resistance for those rainy days on the course.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/water-resistant-img.png"
            }
          },
          "slide_wLbK6E": {
            "type": "Slide",
            "settings": {
              "top_icon": "shopify://shop_images/3max-plus-1000yard-icon.png",
              "title": "",
              "sub_title": "",
              "text": "<p>Whether it’s a lay-up, or from the black tee box on a par 5, its 1000 yard range is sure to capture the exact distance to assist in choosing the right club.</p>",
              "gall_image": "shopify://shop_images/1000yard-range-img.png"
            }
          }
        },
