              "twoColumn__Description": "Streamlined for performance, \nthe PlayMaker+’s zero-profile \naction button is designed to\nstay out of your way while you \nplay. Seamlessly access key \nfeatures without interference, \nensuring every swing stays \nsmooth and uninterrupted. ",
